Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): own blocked PRs first, reload line on #681
 notices

Add the AGENTS.md law "Own blocked PRs first": before an agent claims
a new issue it fixes the open PRs of the current account that have
conflicts or needs-rework. Reconcile "Refresh only at merge time".
Add the check to work-issue, the coordinator and the issue workers.
The #681 process notice now tells running sessions to reload
AGENTS.md, .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/, and forks to run
fork-sync.

Fixes #3133

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
